INSTALL

within parent directory

make all

for more information see ../README.txt

USE


build/json
Output : dump parsed json to standard output.
-d debug
-m non recursive
-c check only (no print)
-b bare : no indentjson_path=<path>
template= filename to open in read only mode to parse in json for template.
          template is used for json unification ie extracting fields from a template pattern
-- to separate options from arguments
First argument : filename to open in read only mode to parse in json.

